==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns.
**4 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even though this stage is available right after clearing Stories of Legend, it is recommended that you attempt this stage after either you get decent progress into Uncanny Legends or good Ubers. If one has him, [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master Uril]] will be amazing for this stage, as he can slow the M. Ost and Oldhorn to a halt. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] is amazing for stalling the Angelic Gories, while [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] can be good for taking out the SBKs. Note that the main threats spawn on base hit, so it is possible to stall the starting enemies until you get more cash. [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] is good for the Oldhorn/M. Ost.

On base hit, the Oldhorn protects the M. Ost, but it also allows you to use wavers and LD units to snipe the M. Ost. Units such as [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] can help with this. Most importantly, this can allow Talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to use his Explosions to hit M. Ost. If you have them, [[Medusa Cat (Rare Cat)|Naga Cat]] is an LD relic crowd controller that can freeze M. Ost and Oldhorn.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Detective Vigler (Uber Rare Cat)|Section Chief Gravicci]]: With his Target Relic and Curse Immune Talents, Gravicci can also work here, as he just barely outranges M. Ost. He can also use the other peons and the Oldhorn as a stepping stone, allowing for easier beatings.
*[[Gaia the Creator (Legend Rare Cat)|Gaia the Supreme]]: Boosted and with attack combos, Gaia can juggle and nuke M. Ost, finishing  him off within a minute. M. Ost's Knockback ability also pushes Gaia into safety.
*[[Trixi the Merc (Uber Rare Cat)|Trixi the Revenant]]: With her Freeze, she completely steamrolls through Oldhorn and M. Ost with proper meatshielding.

